before:
Worked example:

```javascript
function timeoutOutcome(clientTimedOut,receipt) {
  if(receipt) return "confirmed";
  return clientTimedOut ? "unknown" : "waiting";
}
console.log(timeoutOutcome(true, null));
```
The returned value is "unknown".

after:
Here the caller timed out and has no receipt.

```javascript
function timeoutOutcome(clientTimedOut,receipt) {
  if(receipt) return "confirmed";
  return clientTimedOut ? "unknown" : "waiting";
}
console.log(timeoutOutcome(true, null));
```

The output is "unknown". We do not know whether the server finished.
